## Metric: 技能库条目总数

统计技能类对象总量，与按类目拆解的指标配合，观察技能资产整体规模。

### Scope

| Scope Type | Scope Ref |
|------------|-----------|
| object_type | skill |

### Calculation Formula

~~~yaml
version: 1
kind: atomic

atomic:
  aggregation:
    property: id
    aggr: count
~~~

### Time Dimension

| Property | Default Range Policy |
|----------|----------------------|
| create_time | last_24h |

### Analysis Dimensions

| Name | Display Name |
|------|--------------|
| category | 技能分类 |
